  "goodToKnow": "Der Zauberstab is a magic wand, carried by magicians and fairy-tale fairies. Figuratively, politicians often say Es gibt keinen Zauberstab (there's no magic fix). Zaubern means to do magic: ein Lächeln ins Gesicht zaubern. Der Stab means rod or staff, and also a team of staff: der Krisenstab. The hand blender is jokingly also called Zauberstab, after a brand name. Plural: die Zauberstäbe."
